    "description": "Grow your career with Speed Post India Advisory Limited! We are hiring a Distribution Manager for our Dhanbad team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Speed Post India Advisory Limited:\nSpeed Post India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Arch / M.Arch from recognized institution\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in Reverse Logistics\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Learning & development budget\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Dhanbad, Jharkhand, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Speed Post India Advisory Limited!",
